WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Submit: add treatment details, select a policy, and attach medical bills.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Track: follow submission, document review, and the recorded claim decision.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Pay: manage premiums and receipts. Sandbox payments do not move real funds.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Understand: view interactive claim analytics using synthetic sample data.
